l":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/ef332774a8b8d19cd09b2c079761bd8582dc13ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-17T10:38:16Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-17T10:38:16Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"message":"重构：全面优化UI与代码结构，提升用户体验\n\n本次提交对项目进行了全面的现代化改造和代码质量提升：\n\n## 核心改进\n- 重构首页为开发指南页面：精简冗长内容，提供清晰的Rabetbase平台介绍、快速配置和文档导航\n- 全新workbench工作台：采用Bento Grid布局，实现Apple风格的现代化UI设计\n- 优化MainLayout：简化菜单结构，移除冗余文档链接，提升导航清晰度\n- 删除重复的intro页面：避免内容冗余，统一首页为唯一入口\n\n## UI/UX提升\n- 引入CSS Module实现组件级样式隔离\n- 采用现代化配色方案：主色#007aff，成功色#34c759等符合iOS设计规范\n- 添加hover交互效果与流畅的transition动画\n- 优化面包屑导航显示，增强层级感知\n- 响应式布局优化，支持移动端和平板设备\n\n## 代码优化\n- 清理VSCode配置文件，避免项目级编辑器设置干扰\n- 添加品牌logo.svg到public目录\n- 格式化index.html代码，提升可维护性\n- 引入@import别名简化模块导入路径\n- 更新API生成时间戳至2026-01-16\n\n## 配置改进\n- 新增可复制代码块组件，支持MCP、CLI配置快速复制\n- 动态读取AppCode并生成配置示例\n- 提供未配置AppCode的友好提示和初始化指引\n\nCo-Authored-By: Warp <agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"db1291e3af175bef2bc829a2786ad896b8b541b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/db1291e3af175bef2bc829a2786ad896b8b541b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/ef332774a8b8d19cd09b2c079761bd8582dc13ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_