","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/aba957e41b24477bcd097e2cd50df8f88d618225","node_id":"C_kwDOPlH7sdoAKGFiYTk1N2U0MWIyNDQ3N2JjZDA5N2UyY2Q1MGRmOGY4OGQ2MTgyMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/3511f19952ea0c24459e774aa225595416440dea","sha":"3511f19952ea0c24459e774aa225595416440dea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/3511f19952ea0c24459e774aa225595416440dea"}],"sha":"aba957e41b24477bcd097e2cd50df8f88d618225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/aba957e41b24477bcd097e2cd50df8f88d618225"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/3511f19952ea0c24459e774aa225595416440dea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-30T11:34:12Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-30T11:34:12Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"message":"feat: 升级模型配置架构至数组模式并优化SDK集成体验\n\n本次更新对Lovrabet SDK的集成方式进行了重大改进，主要变更包括：\n\n**核心架构升级：**\n- 将模型配置从对象结构升级为数组结构，支持更灵活的模型管理\n- 每个模型现在包含完整的元数据：datasetCode、tableName、name和alias\n- 支持双模式访问：标准dataset_code模式（适合AI/LLM）和人类友好的alias模式\n\n**模型配置优化：**\n- 新增6个业务模型的完整配置：客户访谈记录、迭代信息、需求、需求类型、项目、项目成员\n- 为每个模型配置了语义化的中文名称和驼峰命名的别名\n- 标准化了模型的datasetCode和tableName映射关系\n\n**开发体验提升：**\n- 升级到SDK最新版本（latest），获得最新特性支持\n- 在SDK Demo页面中展示双模式的代码示例，降低学习成本\n- 模型选择下拉框增加搜索功能，支持按名称快速查找\n- 优化代码示例的可读性，明确区分两种访问模式的使用场景\n\n**配置文件改进：**\n- 新增.lovrabetrc到.gitignore，避免敏感配置泄露\n- 为自动生成文件添加时间戳注释，便于追踪生成历史\n- 优化注释文档，提供更清晰的使用指导和示例\n\n**版本管理：**\n- 项目版本从1.0.0升级到1.1.0\n- 依赖包@lovrabet/sdk更新为latest版本\n\nCo-Authored-By: Warp <agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b51f64b5f75417482ef7c9d9a2532884b374f45d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/b51f64b5f75417482ef7c9d9a2532884b374f45d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/3511f19952ea0c24459e774aa225595416440dea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/