i.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/a5e22bcdd32cb0a3940860d2279ae1ae43364d3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-14T15:44:48Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-14T15:44:48Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"message":"feat: 升级React Router到v6并优化路由配置\n\n主要变更：\n- 升级react-router从v7降级到v6.30.1版本，提升兼容性和稳定性\n- 更新所有路由相关导入，从react-router改为react-router-dom\n- 新增深层嵌套路由测试页面(a/b/c路径)，验证路由系统健壮性\n- 优化vite-plugin-pages配置，使用同步导入模式避免Suspense问题\n- 改进错误提示信息，为用户提供更明确的接口权限指导\n- 更新README文档，增加注意事项和格式优化\n\n技术改进：\n- 路由配置使用remix风格，更好兼容React Router v6\n- HTML插件输入路径改为绝对路径，避免嵌套路由问题\n- 新增FolderOutlined图标用于深层路径导航\n- 完善依赖包管理，移除不必要的cookie相关依赖","tree":{"sha":"d4808987103a8a833b805bca6accf69bac914254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/d4808987103a8a833b805bca6accf69bac914254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/a5e22bcdd32cb0a3940860d2279ae1ae43364d3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/a5e22bcdd32cb0a3940860d2279ae1ae43364d3c","node_id":"C_kwDOPlH7sdoAKGE1ZTIyYmNkZDMyY2IwYTM5NDA4NjBkMjI3OWFlMWFlNDMzNjRkM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/7772ff7b262230bb309b7ec3e024c496873c8fe0","sha":"7772ff7b262230bb309b7ec3e024c496873c8fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/7772ff7b262230bb309b7ec3e024c496873c8fe0"}],"sha":"a5e22bcdd32cb0a3940860d2279ae1ae43364d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/a5e22bcdd32cb0a3940860d2279ae1ae43364d3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/7772ff7b262230bb309b7ec3e024c496873c8fe0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-14T09:57:13Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-14T09:57:13Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"message":"docs: 完善README文档，同步约定式路由架构和项目结构\n\n📖 文档完善亮点：\n- 更新项目结构图，准确反映当前的自动路由架构\n- 新增约定式路由使用指南，详细说明文件路由映射规则\n- 完善功能特性描述，突出自动路由生成和数据展示能力\n- 优化开发指南内容，增加动态路由和嵌套路由使用说明\n\n🚀 文档架构优化：\n1. 项目结构更新：展示完整的目录层次，包含components、utils、docs等模块\n2. 功能特性重构：突出自动路由生成、数据可视化、微前端集成等核心能力\n3. 开发指南增强：添加约定式路由映射规则和最佳实践\n4. 使用说明完善：详细的文件路由约定和新增页面流程\n\n📋 约定式路由指南：\n- 文件路由映射：index.tsx → /，table-display.tsx → /table-display\n- 目录结构路由：chart-fetch/index.tsx → /chart-fetch\n- 动态路由支持：[id].tsx → /:id，[userId]/profile.tsx → /user/:userId/profile\n- 嵌套路由能力：支持layout.tsx文件作为嵌套布局组件\n\n💡 开发体验提升：\n- 零配置路由：只需创建.tsx文件，路由自动生成\n- 直观的文件组织：文件路径即URL路径，开发逻辑清晰\n- 完整的功能演示：首页展示、数据表格、图表可视化全覆盖\n- 详细的技术栈说明：React 18、Vite 7、Ant Design v5等现代技术","tree":{"sha":"bd189babf3d861a80a6436c79ba922d044e25f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/bd189babf3d861a80a6436c79ba922d044e25f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/7772ff7b262230bb309b7ec3e024c496873c8fe0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false