","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-14T09:52:52Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"RAM梓骞"},"message":"feat: 全面重构微前端架构，实现基于文件系统的自动路由生成\n\n🚀 核心架构升级：\n- 引入 vite-plugin-pages 实现约定式路由，告别手动路由配置的繁琐\n- 重构页面文件组织结构，支持文件和目录两种路由模式\n- 优化微前端集成方案，基于 icestark + Vite 的现代化构建流程\n- 完善 API 调用架构，统一 Lovrabet 新域名规范\n\n📋 重大功能更新：\n1. 自动路由系统：pages/index.tsx → / 首页，pages/table-display.tsx → /table-display\n2. 智能页面管理：支持 pages/chart-fetch/index.tsx → /chart-fetch 目录结构\n3. API 地址重构：全面迁移到 runtime.lovrabet.com/api 新规范\n4. 组件化重构：HelloWorld → index.tsx，优化文件命名规范\n5. 数据展示增强：表格分页、ECharts 图表、API 状态展示\n\n🔧 技术栈现代化：\n- React 18 + React Router v7：最新路由解决方案\n- Vite v7 + TypeScript 5.8：极速开发体验\n- Ant Design v5 + ECharts：企业级UI + 数据可视化\n- 微前端 icestark：无缝集成主应用能力\n\n📊 开发体验优化：\n- HTTPS 开发环境：解决跨域问题，支持 dev.lovrabet.com\n- 热重载支持：文件变更自动更新路由配置\n- ES Modules 输出：支持主应用动态加载\n- CDN 友好构建：支持版本化资源部署\n\n🛡️ 生产就绪特性：\n- 外部依赖优化：React、Ant Design 通过 CDN 加载\n- 构建产物优化：ES 模块格式，支持 Tree Shaking\n- 跨域配置完善：dev.lovrabet.com 域名白名单支持\n- 详细文档体系：API 变更指南、快速开始文档","tree":{"sha":"4d83ebd559ca95ba4e26d87320871912eb209b8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/4d83ebd559ca95ba4e26d87320871912eb209b8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/2633912037fd4748380b7e23e8a15cf1b4f972c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/or