99ca1a75f998/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-01T08:19:31Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-01T08:19:31Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"message":"feat: 重构代码架构并新增数据表格展示功能\n\n🏗️ 架构重构：\n• 抽离 ApiUrlDisplay 组件为独立可复用组件，支持 props 传参\n• 提取 apiRequest 工具函数到 utils/api.ts，统一API请求逻辑\n• 重构 ChartFetch 组件，移除内联组件和工具函数，提高代码复用性\n\n✨ 新增功能：\n• 添加全新的 TableDisplay 数据表格页面，完整展示API返回的tableData\n• 新增导航菜单项「数据表格」，使用 TableOutlined 图标\n• 实现动态表格列配置，根据 tableColumns 自动生成列定义\n• 集成完整的分页功能，支持页码切换和每页条数调整\n\n🎨 用户体验优化：\n• 表格支持复杂数据类型渲染，自动处理对象和数组显示\n• 添加表格行key生成逻辑，确保React渲染性能\n• 设置表格滚动和省略号显示，适配不同屏幕尺寸\n• 保持统一的错误处理和加载状态显示\n\n📋 路由配置：\n• 在路由中新增 /table-display 页面路径\n• 完善导航系统，支持图表和表格两种数据展示方式","tree":{"sha":"de3fb45769a1a0c07d1fb34ba0f9922346710a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/de3fb45769a1a0c07d1fb34ba0f9922346710a84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/7001a2c7f95cfce9c703bfb31a0499ca1a75f998","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"Us