优化ChartFetch组件的API接口配置和代码质量\n\n✨ 主要变更：\n• 更新API接口从smartapi切换到dbapi调用方式\n• 从xiaoyou租户迁移到yuntoo租户环境\n• 更新应用代码和数据集标识符以适配新环境\n\n🔧 代码优化：\n• 重构字段类型映射逻辑，使用typeNameMap对象替代嵌套三元运算符\n• 改进TypeScript类型注解，为typeMap和column参数添加明确类型\n• 优化JSX代码格式，将内联样式拆分为多行提高可读性\n• 移除Tag组件的size属性，统一组件样式\n\n📝 用户体验提升：\n• 新增API数据源显示，让用户清楚了解数据来源\n• 完善权限和访问提示信息，降低用户使用门槛\n• 保持API解析组件功能完整，便于调试和理解接口结构","tree":{"sha":"cfe3897dd123959c0490e6ce82c4eb7bfebede14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/cfe3897dd123959c0490e6ce82c4eb7bfebede14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/9794f72032df5a4b52e763d435691bc65217f4c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2274940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/9794f72032df5a4b52e763d435691bc65217f4c8","node_id":"C_kwDOPlH7sdoAKDk3OTRmNzIwMzJkZjVhNGI1MmU3NjNkNDM1NjkxYmM2NTIxN2Y0Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commit/cc239c7ef0b464b5efa357c546be