thub.com/users/popotang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/popotang","id":2274940,"login":"popotang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/popotang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/commits/4ff6307d78546c44508dd36ae471d798c4a99499/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-01T06:43:03Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-01T06:43:03Z","email":"3912151@gmail.com","name":"唐爽"},"message":"✨ feat: 全面升级ChartFetch组件，新增智能化数据字段分析功能\n\n🚀 核心功能升级:\n• 重构API数据处理逻辑，从客户状态统计改为数据字段类型分析\n• 新增可视化API URL解析组件，提供详细的接口参数说明\n• 优化数据统计算法，按字段类型前缀进行智能分类汇总\n• 增强错误处理机制，提供更精准的异常提示信息\n\n🎨 用户体验优化:\n• 设计全新的API接口解析展示界面，支持彩色标签化显示\n• 新增常见问题说明模块，主动解决用户权限和跨域问题\n• 完善加载状态提示，从通用加载改为具体的''字段统计数据''加载\n• 更新图表标题和描述，使功能定位更加清晰明确\n\n🔧 技术架构改进:\n• 切换API端点为xiaoyou租户的smartapi接口调用\n• 增加TypeScript类型注解，提升代码质量和开发体验\n• 新增echarts相关依赖包，完善图表渲染能力\n• 清理冗余注释代码，保持代码库整洁度\n\n📊 数据处理增强:\n• 实现字段类型智能识别：TEXT/RADIO/SELECT/NUMBER/DATE等\n• 支持中文字段类型映射，提升用户理解度\n• 优化饼图数据结构，确保图表展示的准确性和美观度\n\n此次更新将ChartFetch从简单的数据展示升级为完整的数据字段分析工具，为用户提供更有价值的数据洞察能力。","tree":{"sha":"92a145349b83b5ea3cceb0e29b72504d032556bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/trees/92a145349b83b5ea3cceb0e29b72504d032556bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lovrabet/sub-app-react-demo/git/commits/4ff6307d78546c44508dd36ae471d798c4a99499","verification"