,"message":"feat: 初始化Gaming Platform共享库\n\n✨ 新增功能:\n- 🔗 统一API客户端 (BaseApiClient)\n  - 支持认证、拦截器、性能监控\n  - 统一错误处理和类型安全\n  - 健康检查和配置管理\n- 📊 分层类型系统\n  - API层: HTTP/WebSocket通信类型\n  - Types层: 系统配置和工具类型\n  - 业务类型由各微应用独立管理\n- 🔌 Module Federation集成\n  - 暴露 apiClient, apiTypes, types, utils 模块\n  - 支持共享依赖优化\n- 📱 开发友好的展示界面\n\n🏗️ 架构特性:\n- 避免代码重复，统一API管理\n- 类型安全，开发体验优秀\n- 性能优化，减少bundle大小\n- 维护简单，集中管理变更\n\n🚀 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"125883d38a7340a10f95daff230c6637c770b4db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-shared/git/trees/125883d38a7340a10f95daff230c6637c770b4db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-shared/git/commits/e0717ea3ce2982d7e52dd5697b69fd7ee9d849be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare","id":6461520,"login":"tokinonagare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE1MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-shared/commit/e0717ea3ce2982d7e