//api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/266e743e8bb5054163ae7b6bf2d20b4ad6a25a12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20283367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77","id":20283367,"login":"Bari77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjgzMzY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/5c55845eee74e03ecf67e6fb5b207d7894704069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:45:54Z","email":"alex.c9777700@gmail.com","name":"Bari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:45:54Z","email":"alex.c9777700@gmail.com","name":"Bari"},"message":"feat(home): give guilds their own rail and share one row component\n\nThe three home rails had each grown their own card markup and styling, so\nthey drifted: different paddings, badges and heights, and the guilds one\nwas still a bare text list. They now render through wow-entity-row, which\nowns the accent bar, the trailing level, the badges and a single\nmin-height, so the columns line up whatever each rail has to say.\n\nThe guilds rail needed the crest, sentence and orientation, none of which\nthe feed selected, so every guild came back wearing the default tabard.\n\nCo-Authored-B