kspace, crests, editable player widgets and search\n\nThe guild sheet becomes a widget workspace with a crest editor in its settings, the roster and the character cards are redrawn as cards, the player presentation and stats widgets save one field at a time, page visibility is pickable on both workspaces, and a global search page replaces the LFG board route.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3922188fd7b41830129e19de9b575d70294bad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/trees/e3922188fd7b41830129e19de9b575d70294bad8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/commits/1cb7f5f62c8b74dc97d920ef980ac0677386145a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/1cb7f5f62c8b74dc97d920ef980ac0677386145a","node_id":"C_kwDOPliw1doAKDFjYjdmNWY2MmM4Yjc0ZGM5N2Q5MjBlZjk4MGFjMDY3NzM4NjE0NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76","sha":"02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76"}],"sha":"1cb7f5f62c8b74dc97d920ef980ac0677386145a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/1cb7f5f62c8b74dc97d920ef980ac0677386145a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:55:38Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:55:38Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"message":"feat(guilds): serve orientations, crests, links and page visibility\n\nGuilds gain a PvE/PvP/PvPE orientation and a tabard, posts carry a visibility, and both the player and guild layouts are trimmed server side to the pages a visitor may open. The friends-only pages ask Platform whether the visitor is a friend, and an unanswered question keeps them hidden.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9d9c4be03970e8c6fd77ca4caf18197ee93fb20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/trees/f9d9c4be03970e8c6fd77ca4caf18197ee93fb20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/commits/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76","node_id":"C_kwDOPliw1doAKDAyZmU2N2U5N2YwYjY0MzU3NGY2MGQzYWZmMmZhMWJkMThiOTNlNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/039caf4c35824b1e6de4460e2b002c3b5dcecc1d","sha":"039caf4c35824b1e6de4460e2b002c3b5dcecc1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/039caf4c35824b1e6de4460e2b002c3b5dcecc1d"}],"sha":"02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/02fe67e97f0b643574f60d3aff2fa1bd18b93e76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20283367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bari77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77","id":20283367,"login":"Bari7