a04623a56560fca6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:30:32Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:30:32Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"message":"chore: bump GamersCommunity.Core packages to 9.6.1","tree":{"sha":"896c4ace6583fc6227fb1e875b11c52b46e8a394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/trees/896c4ace6583fc6227fb1e875b11c52b46e8a394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/commits/ac28d1a7ffcae9c327a0138a04623a56560fca6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/ac28d1a7ffcae9c327a0138a04623a56560fca6c","node_id":"C_kwDOPliw1doAKGFjMjhkMWE3ZmZjYWU5YzMyN2EwMTM4YTA0NjIzYTU2NTYwZmNhNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09","sha":"b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09"}],"sha":"ac28d1a7ffcae9c327a0138a04623a56560fca6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/ac28d1a7ffcae9c327a0138a04623a56560fca6c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:38:49Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:38:49Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"message":"feat(player): add link cards, media galleries and the reworked player sheet\n\nBackend\n- PlayerLink gains card metadata; new PlayerMedia hierarchy (pictures, videos,\n  streams) behind a generic PlayerMediaService<T> with concrete services per kind.\n- PlayerLinkCards migration and the matching DbContext/snapshot updates.\n- RequestPayload centralises the consumer request shape shared by the new services.\n\nFront\n- New links and media features: board, admin panels, stores, services and mocks.\n- Player sheet rebuilt around PlayerHero and a player-workspace model, replacing\n  the old player-dashboard.layout.\n- Shared WowIcon component plus a fetch-wow-icons script, spec-role mapping and\n  game constants, so class and spec art no longer relies on ad-hoc URLs.\n- GameMembershipStore and PlatformGamesService drive the create-sheet-wall gate.\n- Home feed shows the latest characters; LFG chat and guild sheet updated to the\n  gc-skeleton loading approach.\n\nLocale sources and MSW handlers updated to match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1ee61cdc5e3b9df119a1059467ff4d8b59f1d31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/trees/c1ee61cdc5e3b9df119a1059467ff4d8b59f1d31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/git/commits/b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4fedde6fdf4e7d36f09","node_id":"C_kwDOPliw1doAKGI1YmEwN2VhMmRhMTZjNjYxNDAyYjRmZWRkZTZmZGY0ZTdkMzZmMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commit/39275aca5d9ec8a361b74d0d0c963b4ab9a00acf","sha":"39275aca5d9ec8a361b74d0d0c963b4ab9a00acf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.WorldOfWarcraft/commits/39275aca5d9ec8a361b74d0d0c963b4ab9a00acf"}],"sha":"b5ba07ea2da16c661402b4