"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-admin-react/commits/1971fbeb64890acf1fcb88fe9896d45a2469ed1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T06:35:04Z","email":"timemahou@gmail.com","name":"Harry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T06:35:04Z","email":"timemahou@gmail.com","name":"Harry"},"message":"feat: Restructure micro-frontends to match existing business repositories\n\nBased on the provided repository structure, reorganized the micro-frontend\napps to align with actual business modules:\n\nNew App Structure:\n- user-report (4201): User report management system\n- user-transaction (4202): User transaction management system\n- user-profile (4203): User profile management system\n- app-user (4204): Application user management system\n\nChanges Made:\n- Replace generic apps with business-specific modules\n- Update shell webpack remotes configuration\n- Modify routing and navigation in shell app\n- Update sidebar menu items to match new modules\n- Create fallback components for each business module\n- Update build and serve scripts for new app names\n- Modify package.json scripts to match new structure\n- Update README with actual business module descriptions\n\nEach app now corresponds to your independent repositories:\n- user_report_admin_react → apps/user-report\n- user_transaction_admin_react → apps/user-transaction\n- user_profile_admin_react → apps/user-profile\n- app_user_admin_react → apps/app-user\n\nThis structure allows each business module to be developed and deployed\nindependently while maintaining shared UI components and utilities.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"366e0a45ad2c1577beb9111870f2b5f0613261a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-admin-react/git/trees/366e0a45ad2c1577beb9111870f2b5f0613261a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-admin-react/git/commits/1971fbeb64890acf1fcb88fe9896d45a2469ed1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare","id":6461520,"login":"tokinonagare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE1MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare/gaming-admin-react/commit/1971fbeb64890acf1fcb88fe9896d45a2469ed1c","node_id":"C_kwDOPlkjkdoAKDE5NzFmYmViNjQ4OTBhY2YxZmNiODhmZTk4OTZkNDVhMjQ2OWVkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare/gaming-admin-react/commit/8b99bf623d0d848d54a3e3422266c465d5e7e1c1","sha":"8b99bf623d0d848d54a3e3422266c465d5e7e1c1","url":"https://api.g