dules and a test host HTML file for local verification.","tree":{"sha":"cd35d920c5d6a2ed6bf7148c6f768e282210011b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/trees/cd35d920c5d6a2ed6bf7148c6f768e282210011b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/commits/0bdf603958c775def5526facd1a8c6b81e71938f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2193792?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/kilo-code-bot","id":240665456,"login":"kilo-code-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODlhDcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilo-code-bot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/commit/0bdf603958c775def5526facd1a8c6b81e71938f","node_id":"C_kwDOPlmPD9oAKDBiZGY2MDM5NThjNzc1ZGVmNTUyNmZhY2QxYThjNmI4MWU3MTkzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/commit/996e4627b25a53f4c6f8643803e1f466b28e76bd","sha":"996e4627b25a53f4c6f8643803e1f466b28e76bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/commits/996e4627b25a53f4c6f8643803e1f466b28e76bd"}],"sha":"0bdf603958c775def5526facd1a8c6b81e71938f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/commits/0bdf603958c775def5526facd1a8c6b81e71938f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171268075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deangilmoreremix","id":171268075,"login":"deangilmoreremix","node_id":"U_kgDOCjVX6w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/commits/996e4627b25a53f4c6f8643803e1f466b28e76bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T10:33:19Z","email":"dean@videoremix.io","name":"Dean Gilmore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T10:33:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Complete database schema setup and feature initialization for Twenty CRM + AI Enhancements\n\nDatabase Schema (7 migrations):\n1. feature_flags table with RLS policies\n2. saved_pipeline_views table with user isolation\n3. deal_workflows table + workflow_id foreign key in deals\n4. deal_templates table with public/private sharing\n5. enhanced_activities + activity_comments + activity_subscriptions + realtime_sync_status tables\n6. Phase 7 AI tables: deal_scorings, competitor_analyses, deal_insights, automated_notes, action_items, follow_ups, data_enrichments, record_classifications, summary_generations, custom_ai_prompts, prompt_executions (all with RLS)\n7. Updated feature_flags table with DEFAULT values for ALL Twenty CRM + AI feature flags + initialization function\n\nKey Features Implemented:\n- Row Level Security (RLS) on all tables with appropriate policies\n- Database function: increment_sync_version() for real-time tracking\n- Database function: initialize_all_feature_flags() to seed flags\n- Proper foreign key relationships and indexes for performance\n- Service role and authenticated user policies where appropriate\n\nApplication Changes:\n- Fixed supabase imports in useRealtimeSync.ts and enhancedActivityService.ts (use services/supabaseService)\n- Added initializeAllFeatures() call in main.tsx to run on app startup\n- Created initializeFeatures.ts script that:\n  * Calls database initialization function\n  * Verifies required tables exist\n  * Sets default app settings (pipeline columns, view preferences, etc.)\n  * Handles missing functions gracefully\n\nTwenty CRM Feature Flags Now Available:\n✅ Phase 1: twenty_kanban_aggregation, twenty_wip_limits, twenty_custom_columns\n✅ Phase 2: deal_health_indicators, win_probability_calculator, deal_templates_phase3, bulk_deal_actions, deal_timeline\n✅ Phase 3: advanced_table_view, advanced_kanban_view, advanced_dashboard, advanced_calendar_view, saved_views, custom_metrics, advanced_export, advanced_filtering\n✅ Phase 4: twenty_workflow_automation, twenty_workflow_phase5\n✅ Phase 5: twenty_calendar_integration\n✅ Phase 7 AI: All 18 AI feature flags (disabled by default except performance/security)\n✅ Twenty Specific: twenty_views_reporting, twenty_deal_templates, twenty_workflow_phase5_features\n\nDefault State:\n- All Twenty CRM Phase 1-6 features: ENABLED (100% rollout)\n- AI Features: DISABLED (0% rollout) except performance/privacy/rate limiting (100%)\n- Twenty Views & Reporting: ENABLED\n- Twenty Workflow Phase 5: DISABLED (awaiting visual builder)\n\nThis provides a complete foundation for the Twenty CRM integration where:\n1. Features can be gradually rolled out via feature_flags table\n2. Database schema supports all planned functionality\n3. Application initializes correctly on startup\n4. Real-time synchronization is properly tracked\n5. All services have correct supabase import paths\n\nTo enable specific features, update the feature_flags table or use the initialize_all_feature_flags() database function.","tree":{"sha":"ea46e6f4c1ef87a691196056e0fca081f504ed31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/trees/ea46e6f4c1ef87a691196056e0fca081f504ed31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/commits/996e4627b25a53f4c6f8643803e1f466b28e76bd","verification":{"payload":"tree ea46e6f4c1ef87a691196056e0fca081f504ed31\nparent 813f002128902b1e92c414e616af3cbca35b9571\nauthor Dean Gilmore <dean@videoremix.io> 1777458799 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777458799 +0000\n\nComplete database schema setup and feature initialization for Twenty CRM + AI Enhancements\n\nDatabase Schema (7 migrations):\n1. feature_flags table with RLS policies\n2. saved_pipeline_views table with user isolation\n3. deal_workflows table + workflow_id foreign key in deals\n4. deal_templates table with public/private sharing\n5. enhanced_activities + activity_comments + activity_subscriptions + realtime_sync_status tables\n6. Phase 7 AI tables: deal_scorings, competitor_analyses, deal_insights, automated_notes, action_items, follow_ups, data_enrichments, record_classifications, summary_generations, custom_ai_prompts, prompt_executions (all with RLS)\n7. Updated feature_flags table with DEFAULT values for ALL Twenty CRM + AI feature flags + initialization function\n\nKey Features Implemented:\n- Row Level Security (RLS) on all tables with appropriate policies\n- Database function: increment_sync_version() for real-time tracking\n- Database function: initialize_all_feature_flags() to seed flags\n- Proper foreign key relationships and indexes for performance\n- Service role and authenticated user policies where appropriate\n\nApplication Changes:\n- Fixed supabase imports in useRealtimeSync.ts and enhancedActivityService.ts (use services/supabaseService)\n- Added initializeAllFeatures() call in main.tsx to run on app startup\n- Created initializeFeatures.ts script that:\n  * Calls database initialization function\n  * Verifies required tables exist\n  * Sets default app settings (pipeline columns, view preferences, etc.)\n  * Handles missing functions gracefully\n\nTwenty CRM Feature Flags Now Available:\n✅ Phase 1: twenty_kanban_aggregation, twenty_wip_limits, twenty_custom_columns\n✅ Phase 2: deal_health_indicators, win_probability_calculator, deal_templates_phase3, bulk_deal_actions, deal_timeline\n✅ Phase 3: advanced_table_view, advanced_kanban_view, advanced_dashboard, advanced_calendar_view, saved_views, custom_metrics, advanced_export, advanced_filtering\n✅ Phase 4: twenty_workflow_automation, twenty_workflow_phase5\n✅ Phase 5: twenty_calendar_integration\n✅ Phase 7 AI: All 18 AI feature flags (disabled by default except performance/security)\n✅ Twenty Specific: twenty_views_reporting, twenty_deal_templates, twenty_workflow_phase5_features\n\nDefault State:\n- All Twenty CRM Phase 1-6 features: ENABLED (100% rollout)\n- AI Features: DISABLED (0% rollout) except performance/privacy/rate limiting (100%)\n- Twenty Views & Reporting: ENABLED\n- Twenty Workflow Phase 5: DISABLED (awaiting visual builder)\n\nThis provides a complete foundation for the Twenty CRM integration where:\n1. Features can be gradually rolled out via feature_flags table\n2. Database schema supports all planned functionality\n3. Application initializes correctly on startup\n4. Real-time synchronization is properly tracked\n5. All services have correct supabase import paths\n\nTo enable specific features, update the feature_flags table or use the initialize_all_feature_flags() database function.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8d5wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgSkQAD2wTo8GjxJDsZJjrGOnExG2\nuiLoH3SvMFB5Eq7VI0kIPc8pSSBF4aSRWoUqkZ12EpsPgpmdvV/nznPgaULoAEkL\nP7k17gbOYXlvPi1YfVnP9eAUWswDTttEtjtPi5oTUNykXV9G4+/9wg95s4EMQl2U\nV9tjg+vWAc49KrfjG6nptlKOSsN1McPyskKwTXBSVc+o9UgH2LP72mU+U3ARJoYf\nGHsdmr52FZ+bDmorkbJKJvB1+X1CfqkKY6xiD2sCBJL90xNuecXtuiTROS3fHmUT\nYNL18xtJ9mO5Vb3ioajapZC4p9jOCIOOUEMNDhWxnW+Ldq8i5stfZdH5EAN8cIoi\nGThXS9vLZq/UfNhG6yy+i4stivda/c5VuVA5P5J3W25tUfOt+d669lZFLQLaSH9h\nxpHmJpNvg4P35MyxhY1DO9+5l7JP6NURPx4Az0wEkSCq+ss6btKL1t1Rq4tj63lG\nVog9kxzL6W+sE6d94XUmvSV9Zm8BXnw0TEaLaDDvLWKy3Wg6fD175n9UL5Q662fR\n1TO6RX4QZxDSEAva5FWzRYtpteUHJnuqGuFXfPKlJmIFE+mDVnnN6GHIE8/UOV7M\nTlspp2muJ432Qc2WUbQV0txE5EAYl6hLZQzgql5M2qg8hAMPSmw3NLS15VGLIua0\neHGJhFaznbLo/LkAMSYr\n=urI/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T10:33:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us