als/DealWorkflowsPanel.tsx:103\n- src/components/deals/DealTemplatesPanel.tsx:85\n- src/components/Pipeline.tsx:914, 937, 1056","tree":{"sha":"cd365d04380d3aec9c086eadecd51e90ce3939f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/trees/cd365d04380d3aec9c086eadecd51e90ce3939f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/enhancedpipelinedeals/git/commits/813f002128902b1e92c414e616af3cbca35b9571","verification":{"payload":"tree cd365d04380d3aec9c086eadecd51e90ce3939f2\nparent b0bcfecfbb2d5533d1392d124e1e42e3e3ad3cbb\nauthor Dean Gilmore <dean@videoremix.io> 1777453221 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777453221 +0000\n\nComplete unfinished Twenty CRM feature tasks and security hardening\n\nCompleted tasks:\n- Fixed supabase imports: corrected path to lib/core/supabaseClient across 7 services\n- Implemented real-time notifications: added Supabase broadcast in reminderService.sendInAppNotification\n- Created pipeline column management service (pipelineColumnService.ts) with persistence via app_settings\n- Extended PipelineColumn type with position, wipLimit, description\n- CustomColumnManager: replaced hardcoded columns with service-loaded columns\n- Pipeline integration:\n  * Loads custom columns when feature flag enabled\n  * Computes columnOrder dynamically based on position\n  * Auto-populates column.dealIds from deals on load\n  * WIP limit now configurable per column (uses column.wipLimit)\n  * Column changes persisted via onColumnsChange callback\n- SavedViewsPanel: implemented Save Current View with name modal, saves current configuration\n- DealWorkflowsPanel: implemented workflow assignment with dealId prop and assignWorkflowToDeal call\n- DealTemplatesPanel: implemented template application with contactId prop and applyTemplate call\n\nSecurity/best practices:\n- Removed .supabase/config.json (contains db password) from repository tracking\n- Added .supabase/ and coverage/ to .gitignore to prevent future commits of sensitive files and generated coverage reports\n\nNew files:\n- src/types/pipeline.ts\n- src/services/pipelineColumnService.ts\n- src/hooks/useRealtimeSync.ts (untracked hook for deal sync)\n- src/services/enhancedActivityService.ts (untracked service for enhanced activities)\n\nFixes TODO comments in:\n- src/services/reminderService.ts:240\n- src/components/pipeline/kanban/CustomColumnManager.tsx:38\n- src/components/pipeline/SavedViewsPanel.tsx:139\n- src/components/deals/DealWorkflowsPanel.tsx:103\n- src/components/deals/DealTemplatesPanel.tsx:85\n- src/components/Pipeline.tsx:914, 937, 1056\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8cilCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdb8QAK3I7Bd1Ng1Uau9rBn0y2qXt\nkFjaA+WXEWfXZCW/5EwPWU9WPNc6aMlAYg26/RjD40LG+OYve3DRjK4weW6colct\nrSkh3FaD777/P50wirMimLE+SV280CEvdc0ak22gWuPFuV7xPHz8zlmX/wAs5SZ1\nQP4DOMLnPd+FZjR+99gv7N5zk75sr6V/xi9JQc4VzlrrItWtdwmp2prRlp1FVrBU\nvMukSFWOtwU4lZooEWIg877yJ0NGogxODXVJxatNWEMl4QRutLASkuOUZ00saPM6\nG43wUBvZlQw1OxBQKSjHTW0q4zlimQ/BHoS9MGO/W1H8X4rZT2hOwVE+7Cto4R4f\nMTn5aIiM29ukgC1gaMVknhcVFS9RTnODMme77cr7wxuJt1PWyJXkHAKhAcziKdv7\n8igJWmD+N3zgXqgxXb5yxpB851QmVQ6TH/SsWHUUEXIarcIQJ/7zVmpr1C32rbhH\ncAp9fuUFXmz/zqOfPe+0EszvTv7e/GzwrSSUS7kLPqgZvpQH/vQ1QQCRlUSVlZLv\n6U/EYj7zU40YP+LELxFsfNSIkjovvAATPzRw1p+JnQoHhjytOVF6RZejeJIIvzoC\nb23yrvZdy9NoVwhlhGleuNYYc2VQS0SVsC33Ll8aZAF/KmdK+wWb16iWb7+AC2Iz\nsqbZK7CsSW7QaVfgKnXl\n=Z/26\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T09:00:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY