ystemsPage with fireworks, smoke effects, 3D starfield, and force fields\n- Added PhysicsAnimationsPage with realistic bouncing balls, pendulum, springs, and cloth simulation\n- Increased from 914 to thousands of lines of implementation\n\nService Workers/PWAs enhancements:\n- Created OfflineAdvanced with comprehensive sync queue management and cache inspection\n- Implemented sw-advanced.js with multiple caching strategies and background sync\n- Added PushNotificationsAdvanced with rich templates and notification builder\n- Created BackgroundSyncAdvanced with multiple sync strategies and retry logic\n- Increased from 1,579 to 5,135 lines of implementation\n\nBoth projects now feature professional-grade examples and interactive demos.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8347e8340517fc8a726df2487ad5b42285c7d36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/trees/f8347e8340517fc8a726df2487ad5b42285c7d36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/commits/ed0181ef737856270cbb51cd24ec4870dd312043","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14893347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisPeterkins","id":14893347,"login":"ChrisPeterkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODkzMzQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user