 API with interactive worklets (checkerboard, ripples, gradient noise)\n- Properties & Values API with type validation\n- Layout API concepts and future support\n- Animation Worklets for custom timing functions\n- Typed OM demonstrations\n- Browser compatibility matrix\n- Live CSS playground with editable worklets\n\nADVANCED ANIMATIONS LABORATORY:\n- GSAP integration with timeline controls and ScrollTrigger\n- Framer Motion with spring physics and gestures\n- Lottie animations with vector rendering\n- SVG morphing and path animations\n- 3D CSS transforms and perspective effects\n- Performance optimization techniques\n- Animation sequencing and timeline controls\n\nRAY MARCHING & SDFs LABORATORY:\n- Signed Distance Fields fundamentals with primitives\n- Ray marching algorithm visualization\n- 3D fractals (Mandelbulb, Julia sets)\n- Soft shadows and ambient occlusion\n- Volumetric rendering for clouds and fog\n- Interactive GLSL shader editor\n- Performance metrics and GPU optimization\n\nAll projects feature:\n- Complete React + TypeScript implementations\n- Interactive controls and real-time previews\n- Educational content and code examples\n- Responsive design for all devices\n- Dark theme with consistent styling\n- Comprehensive documentation\n\nThe learning platform now has ZERO Coming Soon projects.\nAll 25 projects are fully implemented and functional!\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c162f0661e155c9fdfaabe006cadd754c1def9e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/trees/c162f0661e155c9fdfaabe006cadd754c1def9e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/commits/023b0e48e5c2d0f97bf6572c3512066606778ed1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14893347?v=4","e