ines\n- Complete navigation and routing system\n\nFEATURES ADDED:\n- Interactive architecture comparisons\n- Code examples for all patterns\n- Live demos and simulations\n- Comprehensive CSS styling (1000+ lines)\n- Mobile-responsive design\n- Educational content and best practices\n\nAll projects are now fully accessible from the hub page.\nNo more 404 errors when clicking project cards.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62247bdf1940f7064310ad1eb6bbedc54bc92050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/trees/62247bdf1940f7064310ad1eb6bbedc54bc92050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/commits/d2bd3d6100a383ee1905ecc4ff261fba46773a16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14893347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisPeterkins","id":14893347,"login":"ChrisPeterkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODkzMzQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisPeterkins/learning