api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/commits/beae28fd12458d14e347ef8d5bbcad3bbc19d777/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-29T14:25:45Z","email":"cpeterkins@gmail.com","name":"Chris Peterkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-29T14:25:45Z","email":"cpeterkins@gmail.com","name":"Chris Peterkins"},"message":"Implement all incomplete features across learning platform\n\nMajor implementations completed:\n\nPROCEDURAL GENERATION (4 pages fully implemented):\n- L-Systems: Interactive fractal tree generation with rule editor\n- Maze Generation: Multiple algorithms (Recursive Backtracking, Prim''s, etc.)\n- Vegetation Distribution: Ecological simulations with biome-specific placement\n- Noise Fields: Perlin, Simplex-like, Worley noise visualizations\n\nCREATIVE CODING (1 page implemented):\n- Audio Visualizations: Real-time microphone audio processing and visualization\n\nREACT PATTERNS (2 pages implemented):\n- State Management: Context API, useReducer patterns with live demos\n- Custom Hooks: useCounter, useLocalStorage, useDebounce implementations\n\nALGORITHM VISUALIZATIONS:\n- Search Algorithms: Fully functional linear, binary, and jump search with animations\n\nWEBGL SHADERS:\n- Fixed mouse tracking functionality for interactive shaders\n\nAll implementations include:\n- Interactive Canvas-based visualizations\n- Real-time parameter controls\n- Educational explanations\n- Performance optimizations\n- TypeScript throughout\n\nThis transforms 10+ \"Coming Soon\" placeholders into fully functional, interactive learning experiences.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"693c306f0ef68d34