erkins","id":14893347,"login":"ChrisPeterkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODkzMzQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/commits/45434889d66f6d53fa13f63837449e4e64396ccd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-29T13:59:22Z","email":"cpeterkins@gmail.com","name":"Chris Peterkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-29T13:59:22Z","email":"cpeterkins@gmail.com","name":"Chris Peterkins"},"message":"Complete learning.chrispeterkins.com repository\n\nThis commit includes the entire learning platform with:\n\nHomepage:\n- Main index.html with links to all learning projects\n- Server configuration and deployment scripts\n\nThree.js Examples (12 interactive examples):\n- 01-basics through 12-game-concepts\n- Complete with styles and updated navigation\n\nLearning Projects (22 comprehensive projects):\n- algorithm-visualizations: Sorting, searching, pathfinding visualizers\n- browser-devtools: DevTools exploration and understanding\n- canvas-animations: Creative coding with canvas\n- creative-coding: Generative art and patterns\n- css-animations: CSS Grid, Flexbox, animations\n- data-visualization: D3.js charts and visualizations\n- game-development: Game engine concepts and physics\n- graphql-apis: GraphQL vs REST, schemas, subscriptions\n- micro-frontends: Module federation demos\n- nodejs-deep-dive: Event loop, streams, workers\n- performance-lab: Optimization techniques\n- procedural-generation: Terrain, dungeons, L-systems\n- react-patterns: Hooks and patterns deep dive\n- service-workers-pwas: Offline capabilities, caching\n- state-management: Zustand, Jotai, Valtio comparisons\n- testing-strategies: Unit, integration, E2E testing\n- three-js: Basic Three.js experiments\n- typescript-patterns: Advanced TypeScript patterns\n- web-audio: Audio synthesis and visualization\n- webassembly: WASM performance comparisons\n- webgl-shaders: Shader programming playground\n- webrtc-deep-dive: Peer connections, video chat\n\nAll projects include complete source code, dependencies, and configurations.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed4e2f8f0c3bc5e247aec54ae89febb67db05481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/trees/ed4e2f8f0c3bc5e247aec54ae89febb67db05481"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChrisPeterkins/learning.chrispeterkins.com/git/commits/45434889d66f6d53fa13f63837449e4e64396ccd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14893347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisPeterkins","id":14893347,"login":"ChrisPeterkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODkzMzQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisPeterkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c