g simulation for contact generation\n- Enhanced mode-specific handling in UniversalAIAssistant\n\n## 🎨 UI/UX Improvements\n- Made AI Auto-Fill and AI Research buttons visible from contact modal start\n- Removed conditional rendering that hid AI buttons until contact data entered\n- Added comprehensive debugging to view toggle buttons\n- Enhanced button tooltips and visual feedback\n- Added current view indicator in header for debugging\n\n## 🔧 Technical Fixes\n- Updated UniversalAIAssistant to handle different modes properly\n- Added generateContactSuggestion function for contact-specific AI\n- Improved AIEnrichmentService integration\n- Enhanced error handling and fallback logic\n\n## 📱 Component Updates\n- NewContactModal: AI buttons now visible immediately\n- UniversalAIAssistant: Better contact mode support\n- App.tsx: Added debugging and visual indicators\n- AIAutoFillButton: Improved conditional logic\n\n## 🧪 Testing & Debugging\n- Added console logging for view state changes\n- Implemented visual current view indicator\n- Enhanced button click tracking\n- Improved component rendering verification\n\n## 📋 Files Modified\n- src/App.tsx - View toggle debugging and indicators\n- src/components/NewContactModal.tsx - AI button visibility\n- src/components/ui/UniversalAIAssistant.tsx - Contact mode support\n- src/components/ui/AIAutoFillButton.tsx - Conditional logic\n- README.md - Documentation updates","tree":{"sha":"a1b1a773edc396b15f6875c57b945d5c858f6aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/aicalendarapp/git/trees/a1b1a773edc396b15f6875c57b945d5c858f6aa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/aicalendarapp/git/commits/efe01229e41b8febde8623709e5128d864c0915b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171268075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/events{/privacy}","followe