ehensive AI function calling for app actions\n- Streaming AI: Added real-time AI streaming with thinking indicators and citations\n\n🎨 UI/UX Improvements:\n- Removed ''Learn More'' button from contacts modal header\n- Fixed AI filter dropdown positioning to open upwards (prevents covering contacts)\n- Enhanced modal designs with consistent styling and AI features\n\n🔧 Technical Enhancements:\n- Extended API service with deal operations and stage management\n- Added comprehensive function registry for AI actions (create/update contacts, tasks, deals, meetings, emails)\n- Enhanced streaming client with function call support\n- Fixed TypeScript errors in contact detail view\n\n📊 Data Persistence:\n- Confirmed Supabase integration for contacts, tasks, and deals\n- All CRUD operations properly persist to database\n- Schema validation and type safety maintained\n\n🧪 Components Created/Updated:\n- NewDealModal.tsx - Complete deal creation interface\n- dealStore.ts - Deal state management\n- ContactsModal.tsx - UI fixes and type fixes\n- QuickActions.tsx - Added deal creation trigger\n- App.tsx - Integrated new deal modal\n- Multiple streaming and AI components\n\n✅ Quality Assurance:\n- Fixed dropdown positioning issues\n- Resolved TypeScript compilation errors\n- Maintained consistent design patterns\n- Ensured proper error handling and loading states","tree":{"sha":"c5046c2a1765d9ac53859d2498a5b37b2cdcd204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/aicalendarapp/git/trees/c5046c2a1765d9ac53859d2498a5b37b2cdcd204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deangilmoreremix/aicalendarapp/git/commits/dd3b440e43fb1ca1275d28c6e215f0690f7b3fb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171268075?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deangilmoreremix/foll